compatibility.

The gfmrag/ultra/ directory vendors code from ULTRA
(https://github.com/DeepGraphLearning/ULTRA), Copyright (c) DeepGraphLearning
and contributors, licensed under the MIT License.

The SimGRAG-style query-graph pattern matching in gfmrag/query_pattern/
and gfmrag/kg_construction/micro_matcher/ is adapted from SimGRAG
(https://github.com/YZ-Cai/SimGRAG).

Design inspiration was additionally drawn from HippoRAG
(https://github.com/OSU-NLP-Group/HippoRAG) and Microsoft GraphRAG
(https://github.com/microsoft/graphrag).
